would have been preachers.


02:05:00.395 --> 02:05:03.637
If you had been a soldier,
they'd be soldiers, you know that.


02:05:04.042 --> 02:05:06.105
They all came here because of you.


02:05:06.694 --> 02:05:09.015
- You called and they came, right?
- Right.


02:05:09.273 --> 02:05:11.962
That's because they look up to you.


02:05:12.957 --> 02:05:16.788
They always expect you
to know what's best.


02:05:17.451 --> 02:05:18.925
But even they know...


02:05:19.661 --> 02:05:21.135
you don't shoot cops!


02:05:23.603 --> 02:05:24.966
Even I know that.


02:05:26.513 --> 02:05:27.840
- Heaven knows it.
- Right.


02:05:28.024 --> 02:05:30.492
The only one who doesn't
seem to know is you!


02:05:30.676 --> 02:05:31.966
- All right, Ma.
- It's...


02:05:32.150 --> 02:05:33.918
I promise you
I won't shoot anyone.


02:05:34.102 --> 02:05:36.681
I never asked you
where all this came from.


02:05:36.902 --> 02:05:39.333
- cause I didn't want to hear you lie.
- Don't you worry about it.


02:05:39.481 --> 02:05:41.359
- I gotta go.
- Don't lie to me!


02:05:46.038 --> 02:05:47.290
Don't do that.


02:05:48.580 --> 02:05:50.164
- Come on.
- Do you want to...


02:05:50.790 --> 02:05:52.337
make things so bad


02:05:52.558 --> 02:05:54.474
