that they'll leave you?


02:05:54.621 --> 02:05:56.426
- Cause they will.
- I understand.


02:05:56.574 --> 02:05:58.637
She will leave


02:05:58.821 --> 02:06:00.184
- you.
- All right.


02:06:02.984 --> 02:06:04.163
I will leave you.


02:06:32.307 --> 02:06:33.891
Coffins on the move, Richie.


02:06:34.039 --> 02:06:37.133
We want the transport coffins,
not the ceremonial ones.


02:06:38.496 --> 02:06:39.859
Who are these guys?


02:06:42.438 --> 02:06:43.580
