projects right now.


02:09:00.362 --> 02:09:02.499
<i>Are you sure this is it?
You're positive?</i>


02:09:02.794 --> 02:09:05.078
<i>Positive, Lou,
I'm positive, okay?</i>


02:09:05.262 --> 02:09:07.583
<i>Everything's ready to go,
all the guys are ready to go,</i>


02:09:07.767 --> 02:09:09.977
just push the button,
gimme the warrant, okay?


02:09:10.198 --> 02:09:11.709
Okay, you got it.


02:10:13.487 --> 02:10:15.292
- I got the warrant.
- All right.


02:10:19.197 --> 02:10:20.229
Let's go!


02:10:37.395 --> 02:10:38.353
Move.


02:10:41.669 --> 02:10:44.026
- M'am, what's your name?
- What's going on?


02:10:45.426 --> 02:10:47.526
Get down!
Down, motherfucker!


02:10:49.884 --> 02:10:51.136
Let's go, Al.


02:10:51.542 --> 02:10:52.610
C'mon.


02:10:54.194 --> 02:10:55.520
