02:11:40.279 --> 02:11:41.311
Roger.


02:11:44.258 --> 02:11:45.216
Here you go.


02:11:48.126 --> 02:11:49.047
C'mon!


02:11:57.225 --> 02:11:58.256
At target.


02:11:59.214 --> 02:12:01.240
Spearman, stand by.


02:12:01.830 --> 02:12:04.114
<i>I got civilians on the target floor.</i>


02:12:06.840 --> 02:12:07.761
