02:12:23.196 --> 02:12:24.780
What's happenin, Suzie?


02:12:33.511 --> 02:12:34.874
Where you goin?


02:12:35.574 --> 02:12:36.606
Come on.


02:12:38.779 --> 02:12:40.068
I'll get it.


02:12:42.463 --> 02:12:43.679
Where's Tim?


02:12:44.673 --> 02:12:45.705
Quiet, kid.


02:12:52.778 --> 02:12:54.841
Yo, some sandwiches
for the boys, man.


02:12:57.714 --> 02:12:58.819
Where is Tim?


02:13:00.182 --> 02:13:01.656
Tim's always playing around.


02:13:03.056 --> 02:13:04.050
Hey man!


02:13:05.082 --> 02:13:06.813
You got some Blue Magic?


02:13:08.287 --> 02:13:09.650
Fucking junkie.


02:13:10.608 --> 02:13:11.971
Yo, handle that!


02:13:12.339 --> 02:13:14.181
C'mon, I got money, man!


02:13:14.402 --> 02:13:15.470
You know me, baby!


02:13:15.655 --> 02:13:18.344
C'mon, I need that Blue Magic, man!


02:13:18.454 --> 02:13:19.928
It's me, baby!


02:13:20.186 --> 02:13:22.175
You know me, I got money.


02:13:23.280 --> 02:13:25.270
Get outa here.
Fuckin junkie!


02:13:27.111 --> 02:13:27.996
Police!


02:13:29.432 --> 02:13:30.758
- Drop it!
- Get down!


02:13:30.980 --> 02:13:32.416
- Drop your gun!
- Don't do it!


02:13:32.564 --> 02:13:34.037
- Drop your gun!
- Don't do it!


02:13:36.395 --> 02:13:37.316
Scotty!


02:13:41.000 --> 02:13:42.473
- Freeze!
- Police!


02:13:45.236 --> 02:13:46.489
Fuck you, motherfucker!


02:13:48.699 --> 02:13:49.804
Nobody moves!


02:13:49.915 --> 02:13:51.204
Don't let'em get away!


02:14:00.303 --> 02:14:01.335
Fuckin move!


02:14:12.018 --> 02:14:13.970
I wanna see your hands!
All the hands!


02:14:14.191 --> 02:14:15.075
Police!


02:14:18.870 --> 02:14:20.712
Down! Get down!


02:14:20.970 --> 02:14:22.333
Stay the fuck there!


02:15:22.048 --> 02:15:23.080
What the hell?


02:15:36.121 --> 02:15:38.220
Stay down!
Down, motherfucker!


02:15:38.626 --> 02:15:39.620
Hands!


02:15:45.036 --> 02:15:46.435
Out of home, baby.


02:15:57.892 --> 02:15:59.882
- Thank you.
- You're welcome.


02:16:00.397 --> 02:16:01.760
You all wait right here.


02:16:27.732 --> 02:16:29.316
Lucas,
please step back inside.


02:16:30.237 --> 02:16:31.710
Please, step inside.


02:16:31.894 --> 02:16:34.142
Respectfully, please,
step inside. Thank you.


02:16:47.367 --> 02:16:48.398
Stay back!


02:16:57.166 --> 02:16:58.455
Yo, the pigs.


02:16:59.450 --> 02:17:01.476
NYPD, everybody stay still.


02:17:04.644 --> 02:17:05.860
Turner! Go!


02:17:43.435 --> 02:17:44.504
"Dead servicemen... "


02:17:44.688 --> 02:17:48.003
"Dead servicemen
trying to defend our country... "


02:17:59.313 --> 02:18:03.144
Ladies and gentlemen, at this stage
of the proceedings, the counsels


02:18:03.439 --> 02:18:05.539
are ready for their opening statements.


02:18:05.944 --> 02:18:07.454
For the prosecution,


02:18:07.675 --> 02:18:09.038
Mr. Roberts will proceed


02:18:09.259 --> 02:18:11.285
with his opening statement first.


02:18:11.764 --> 02:18:13.054
Mr. Roberts!


02:18:14.343 --> 02:18:15.964
Are you ready to proceed?


02:18:17.437 --> 02:18:18.653
Yes, your Honor.


02:18:23.074 --> 02:18:25.063
Ladies and gentlemen of the jury.


02:18:29.999 --> 02:18:33.020
The State will show,
and you will hear


02:18:33.867 --> 02:18:37.036
that Frank Lucas
is the most dangerous man


02:18:37.883 --> 02:18:39.725
walking the streets of our city.


02:18:42.893 --> 02:18:44.624
You all get on out.
Let me


02:18:45.177 --> 02:18:46.872
talk to Mr. Richie alone.


02:18:49.966 --> 02:18:52.434
C'mon, I pay you by the hour,
not by the minute.


02:18:56.339 --> 02:18:57.407
Thank you.


02:19:02.307 --> 02:19:03.928
You ain't wearin a wire?


02:19:08.533 --> 02:19:12.659
I was talking to my lawyers,
they said something I can't believe.


02:19:14.390 --> 02:19:15.753
Did you really


02:19:15.974 --> 02:19:17.853
find a million $ in the trunk of a car


02:19:18.074 --> 02:19:19.474
- and then turn it in?
- Yeah.


02:19:19.658 --> 02:19:21.979
You did that for real, huh?
My man!


02:19:22.347 --> 02:19:24.152
Good for you.
Shit...


02:19:24.484 --> 02:19:26.436
You know johnny law
got the dough, right?


02:19:26.584 --> 02:19:28.573
- Maybe.
- Ain't no "maybe", Mr. Richie.


02:19:28.757 --> 02:19:30.931
You know he got it.
You turned that money in,


02:19:31.152 --> 02:19:33.473
he took it, and you ain't
gettin nothin for it, did you?


02:19:33.841 --> 02:19:35.278
Why did you do that?


02:19:35.757 --> 02:19:38.262
- It was the right thing to do.
- It's true.


02:19:38.630 --> 02:19:41.135
Good answer, it was the right thing.
The question I have


02:19:41.356 --> 02:19:44.414
that I've been asking myself
is would you do it again?


02:19:45.482 --> 02:19:47.729
That's a lot of money
and a long time ago.


02:19:48.945 --> 02:19:52.702
Many car payments ago.
Many child support payments ago.


02:19:54.250 --> 02:19:57.897
So I said to myself the only way
to find out is to find out.


02:19:59.518 --> 02:20:00.623
<i>Bribery,</i>


02:20:01.359 --> 02:20:03.128
extortion, murder,


02:20:03.754 --> 02:20:05.154
racketeering...


02:20:07.401 --> 02:20:08.875
<i>If you would give me an address,</i>


02:20:09.096 --> 02:20:11.490
<i>I'll make sure the car's there,
and the money's in that trunk.</i>


02:20:12.743 --> 02:20:13.958
No, thanks.


02:20:14.585 --> 02:20:15.800
You sure?


02:20:17.568 --> 02:20:19.816
C'mon now,
what you think, that impresses me?


02:20:20.368 --> 02:20:23.242
You think you're better than them,
you're no better than them other cops,


02:20:23.389 --> 02:20:24.605
You're the same as them.


02:20:24.863 --> 02:20:26.041
You are them.


02:20:26.778 --> 02:20:27.994
Let me ask you this.


02:20:28.178 --> 02:20:31.199
Do you really think
that putting me behind bars


02:20:31.420 --> 02:20:33.151
will change anything on the streets?


02:20:33.299 --> 02:20:36.946
Them dope fiends are going to shoot it,
steal from it, and die for it.


02:20:37.351 --> 02:20:39.340
Putting me in or out
won't change anything.


02:20:40.703 --> 02:20:43.540
- That's the way it is.
- Right, so what we got, Richie?


02:20:43.871 --> 02:20:45.676
We got me and you sitting here.


02:20:46.155 --> 02:20:48.808
<i>You got that snitch ass
driving for my brother,</i>


02:20:48.955 --> 02:20:50.723
<i>you got a little bit of powder.</i>


02:20:51.018 --> 02:20:52.565
<i>You gonna need more than that.</i>


02:20:52.713 --> 02:20:55.660
<i>I got possession, supply,
conspiracy...</i>


02:20:56.728 --> 02:20:57.981
<i>bribing a law officer.</i>


02:20:58.165 --> 02:21:00.301
<i>I got people attesting
to seeing you kill in cold blood.</i>


02:21:00.854 --> 02:21:02.475
<i>I got your offshore bank accounts,</i>


02:21:02.659 --> 02:21:04.206
<i>your real estate, your businesses.</i>


02:21:04.833 --> 02:21:06.601
All bought with money from heroin.


02:21:08.001 --> 02:21:10.322
I got hundreds of parents
of dead kids


02:21:10.800 --> 02:21:13.490
addicts who o'ded on your product,
and that's my story for the jury,


02:21:13.600 --> 02:21:16.805
that's how I make it all stick.
This man murdered thousands of people.


02:21:16.989 --> 02:21:19.052
And he did it from a penthouse,
driving a Lincoln.


02:21:19.273 --> 02:21:21.115
besides that,
you got nothing to worry about.


02:21:21.299 --> 02:21:23.952
That's pretty good,
but that's why we go to court, right?


02:21:24.062 --> 02:21:25.425
Cause I got witnesses too.


02:21:25.573 --> 02:21:27.930
I got celebrities,
I got sport figures,


02:21:28.078 --> 02:21:29.625
I got Harlem, Richie.


02:21:30.546 --> 02:21:33.972
I took care of Harlem, so it's gonna
take care of me, you can believe that.


02:21:34.230 --> 02:21:36.109
- I got more than that.
- What you got?


02:21:36.588 --> 02:21:39.240
I got a line of people
wanting to testify against you


02:21:39.424 --> 02:21:41.340
that stretches out the door
and around the block.


02:21:41.561 --> 02:21:44.213
<i>- Bullshit.
- You damaged a lot of lives, Frank.</i>


02:21:44.766 --> 02:21:47.455
<i>I got the Mazzano crime family.
You put them out of business.</i>


02:21:47.602 --> 02:21:50.071
I got nothin to do with 'em.
They got nothin to do with me.


02:21:50.255 --> 02:21:52.097
They got everything to do with you.
Know why?


02:21:52.244 --> 02:21:53.239
Why?


02:21:53.460 --> 02:21:55.744
Because
apart from the fact they hate you,


02:21:56.149 --> 02:21:58.801
- they hate what you represent.
- I don't represent nothing


02:21:58.986 --> 02:22:00.864
- but Frank Lucas.
- You sure?


02:22:01.196 --> 02:22:02.854
A black businessman like you.


02:22:03.443 --> 02:22:05.211
You represent progress.


02:22:05.690 --> 02:22:08.600
The kind that's gonna see them
lose a lot of money.


02:22:09.337 --> 02:22:10.921
With you out of the way,


02:22:11.179 --> 02:22:13.168
everything can return to normal.


02:22:13.942 --> 02:22:15.010
My man.


02:22:19.984 --> 02:22:22.120
You know what normal is to me?


02:22:22.415 --> 02:22:24.883
I ain't see normal
since I was 6 years old.


02:22:26.762 --> 02:22:29.598
Normal is seeing the police
ride up to my house,


02:22:29.746 --> 02:22:32.693
dragging my 12 year old cousin out
and tying him to a pole.


02:22:32.914 --> 02:22:35.677
Shoving a shotgun in his mouth
so hard they bust his teeth.


02:22:35.861 --> 02:22:38.882
Then they bust two shotgun shells
in his head, knocking it off.


02:22:39.029 --> 02:22:40.503
That's what normal is to me.


02:22:40.797 --> 02:22:42.234
Didn't give a fuck about no...


02:22:43.045 --> 02:22:45.513
police then. Don't give a fuck
about no police now.


02:22:45.808 --> 02:22:46.802
Shit.


02:22:47.097 --> 02:22:49.270
You can do whatever you wanna do.


02:22:49.491 --> 02:22:52.033
So it don't mean nothing to me
for you to show up tomorrow


02:22:52.181 --> 02:22:54.023
with your head blown off,
you understand?


02:22:54.980 --> 02:22:56.159
Hey, Frank.


02:22:56.454 --> 02:22:57.559
Get in line,


02:22:58.112 --> 02:23:00.322
That one
stretches around the block, too.


02:23:03.858 --> 02:23:04.927
All right.


02:23:08.979 --> 02:23:10.268
What you wanna do?


02:23:17.047 --> 02:23:18.557
You know what you gotta do.


02:23:18.815 --> 02:23:20.510
What you want me to do?
Snitch?


02:23:20.657 --> 02:23:24.230
I know you don't want no cops.
What you want? Gangsters?


02:23:24.636 --> 02:23:25.704
Pick one.


02:23:25.925 --> 02:23:28.062
Jew gangsters, mick gangsters,
guinees?


02:23:28.614 --> 02:23:31.340
They been bleeding Harlem dry
since they got off the boat.


02:23:31.561 --> 02:23:33.808
I don't give a fuck
about no crime figures.


02:23:34.250 --> 02:23:35.282
You can have them.


02:23:36.387 --> 02:23:37.824
I'll take them too.


02:23:38.045 --> 02:23:39.776
You'll take them too?


02:23:45.081 --> 02:23:46.297
No you didn't.


02:23:46.481 --> 02:23:48.507
You talkin about police?
You want police?


02:23:49.502 --> 02:23:51.970
- You want your own kind?
- They're not my kind.


02:23:52.596 --> 02:23:54.733
They're in business with you,
they ain't my kind.


02:23:55.433 --> 02:23:58.711
They ain't my kind
like the Italians are not yours.


02:24:12.931 --> 02:24:14.736
What can you promise me, Richie?


02:24:18.346 --> 02:24:21.183
I can promise you,
you lie about one name...


02:24:21.772 --> 02:24:23.467
You'll never get out of prison.


02:24:23.835 --> 02:24:26.561
You lie about one dollar,
one offshore account.


02:24:26.893 --> 02:24:28.440
You'll never get out of prison.


02:24:29.951 --> 02:24:32.235
You can live life rich in jail


02:24:32.529 --> 02:24:34.408
the rest of your boring days,


02:24:34.813 --> 02:24:37.134
or be poor outside for some of them.


02:24:38.313 --> 02:24:40.192
That's what I can promise you.


02:24:43.323 --> 02:24:45.054
<i>I want them cops, Richie.</i>


02:24:47.523 --> 02:24:49.659
That's what I want,
I want them cops


02:24:51.170 --> 02:24:53.601
that took money out of my pockets.


02:24:56.953 --> 02:24:58.022
Him too.


02:24:58.537 --> 02:24:59.790
All right.


02:25:02.516 --> 02:25:03.990
Hey, Spearman.


02:25:05.242 --> 02:25:08.005
These guys are all connected
on the grid.


02:25:08.337 --> 02:25:10.621
This guy here, he's in uniform.


02:25:11.763 --> 02:25:15.078
<i>Police officers were arrested
today on charges of taking bribes</i>


02:25:15.262 --> 02:25:17.620
<i>- from drug traffickers.
- Well done, Jimmy!</i>


02:25:18.062 --> 02:25:20.051
<i>The investigation into police corruption</i>


02:25:20.199 --> 02:25:23.035
<i>has swept through New York
drug enforcement ranks,</i>


02:25:23.219 --> 02:25:24.914
<i>broadened today with the arrest...</i>


02:25:25.098 --> 02:25:27.935
You're under arrest.
You have the right to remain silent.


02:25:28.229 --> 02:25:31.361
<i>In what's being called the city's
largest police corruption scandal,</i>


02:25:31.508 --> 02:25:35.597
<i>32 more officers were indicted today
in federal court on bribery charges.</i>


02:25:35.966 --> 02:25:37.108
<i>These police officers</i>


02:25:37.365 --> 02:25:39.244
<i>will face stiff prison terms</i>


02:25:39.502 --> 02:25:41.860
<i>say federal prosecutors,
if found guilty.</i>


02:25:42.265 --> 02:25:44.512
<i>A report by federal investigators
into New York's</i>


02:25:44.733 --> 02:25:46.649
<i>ever widening
police corruption scandal</i>


02:25:46.870 --> 02:25:49.743
<i>claims that more than half
of the city's officers</i>


02:25:49.927 --> 02:25:51.290
<i>assigned to drug enforcement</i>


02:25:51.438 --> 02:25:53.648
<i>have engaged
in some form of corruption.</i>


02:25:58.032 --> 02:25:59.284
<i>...narcotics squad,</i>


02:25:59.469 --> 02:26:00.758
<i>S.I.U.,</i>


02:26:01.016 --> 02:26:04.368
<i>has led to the arrest
of 4 New York detectives today.</i>


02:26:04.589 --> 02:26:05.952
<i>Convicted of extortion,</i>


02:26:06.136 --> 02:26:09.268
<i>members of New York City's
Special Investigations Narcotics Unit</i>


02:26:09.673 --> 02:26:12.694
<i>will face sentencing today,
in federal court.</i>


02:26:14.352 --> 02:26:16.304
McNamara, Vendazzo,


02:26:18.404 --> 02:26:19.509
Trupo.


02:26:23.045 --> 02:26:24.261
You are special.


02:27:08.247 --> 02:27:09.757
It's good work, Frank.


02:27:11.267 --> 02:27:12.262
You know...


02:27:12.925 --> 02:27:15.099
You don't want a drink or somethin'?


02:27:15.393 --> 02:27:16.535
To celebrate.


02:27:16.977 --> 02:27:18.561
You got any holy water?


02:28:12.862 --> 02:28:14.077
Check your property.


02:28:14.851 --> 02:28:16.361
Sign right here.

